    </Box>

    <Box style={{ background: 'rgba(251,191,36,0.06)', border: '1px solid #6B5320', borderLeft: '4px solid #FBBF24', borderRadius: 12, paddingLeft: 22, paddingRight: 22, paddingTop: 16, paddingBottom: 16, gap: 10 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#E2E8F0', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>Skill 演示：说「帮我生成周训练报告」→ Agent 调 read_skill("weekly-report") 读取 SKILL.md → 按模板调 compute_fatigue 等计算 → <span style={{ color: '#FBBF24', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>展示全文征得同意后</span>才调 write_weekly_report 写入 output/周训练报告_*.md</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#94A3B8', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>写文件是全流程唯一的「危险操作」：先确认、后写入，且只能写 output/ 目录，路径逃逸由单元测试拦截。</Text>
    </Box>

